            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In order to provide the appropriate care with regard to nutrition and the fight against frailty, it is important to know how to analyse the physical and physiological capacities of the ageing population. These are assessed in relation to the measurement of the patient's muscle strength, walking speed and balance.</AbstractText>
